          "number": "a",
          "id": "32-a",
          "line_start": 6,
          "text": "(a) bonus or commission paid to an employee for services rendered, but only when such amount would not have been payable to the employee as profits or dividend if it had not been paid as bonus or commission;",
          "children": []
